From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Janne Grunau <j@jannau.net>
Date: Wed, 24 Dec 2025 13:12:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm: apple: Move plane bits out of apple_drv/iomfb_flush

Now that dcp may use multiple planes with more complex paramters move
this out of iomfb_flush and use the appropriate KMS atomic plane helper
functions.
Also move most plane handling functions from apple_drv.c to its own
file.

Signed-off-by: Janne Grunau <j@jannau.net>
